TITLE Pure water (pH 7, pe 4) equilibrated with fixed-pressure gas phase at 150C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g)  0.4
    CO2(g)  0.4
    NH3(g)  0.2
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
